msgid "How to Calculate Your Premium and Insurable Earnings"
msgstr "Comment calculer votre prime et vos gains assurables"

#. module: l10n_ca_on_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,name:l10n_ca_on_payroll.source_wsib_report_pay
